WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.260 --> 00:00:03.520
Rob's World!

00:00:04.480 --> 00:00:08.280
Hey what's up guys and welcome to my
tutorial for the ninja star fidget

00:00:08.280 --> 00:00:11.190
spinner! I really like this spinner
because you can spin it on a paperclip

00:00:11.190 --> 00:00:16.260
or you can even spin it on the table and
it's a lot of fun. For this tutorial I'm

00:00:16.260 --> 00:00:19.650
going to be using a red and a blue
printer sheet which are my two favorite

00:00:19.650 --> 00:00:23.250
colors but in total we're only going to
be using half of a printer sheet so that

00:00:23.250 --> 00:00:28.619
means you can make 4 ninja stars with 2
sheets. I'll also be using a Bic pen for

00:00:28.619 --> 00:00:32.340
the cartridge that's inside however most
other pens will have a suitable

00:00:32.340 --> 00:00:36.149
cartridge. We're also going to cut the
tip off of the pen cartridge so if you

00:00:36.149 --> 00:00:40.620
have a pair of scissors pliers or even a
knife that'll be very helpful and I'm

00:00:40.620 --> 00:00:44.219
going to be using a paper clip either
large or small whichever one you guys

00:00:44.219 --> 00:00:48.000
have is fine. If you don't have the pen
cartridge it's ok it'll still spin on

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:51.870
the paper clip but just not as well so
grab all your supplies and let's get

00:00:51.870 --> 00:00:54.930
started but I do have a surprise for you
guys I'm also going to teach you the

00:00:54.930 --> 00:00:58.859
origami infinity kaleidoscope in a
separate video so be sure to check that

00:00:58.859 --> 00:01:02.730
out by clicking on the link and the
upper right hand side of the video this

00:01:02.730 --> 00:01:05.970
is really cool as it spins like this
forever and it looks really awesome

00:01:05.970 --> 00:01:10.049
alright so I'm just going to set these
pens which I'm going to be using aside

00:01:10.049 --> 00:01:14.970
they're the round stick Xtra Life ones
and these are the paper clips I'm going

00:01:14.970 --> 00:01:19.619
to be splitting both of these papers in
half first so that you have a sheet like

00:01:19.619 --> 00:01:24.180
this and then I'm going to be splitting
these halves in half so I'm basically

00:01:24.180 --> 00:01:28.740
going to be having two quarters of a
piece of paper in order to make the

00:01:28.740 --> 00:01:31.710
ninja star and this is the easiest way I
know how to make it so I'm just

00:01:31.710 --> 00:01:34.979
basically going to split them in half
and speed it up a little bit just gonna

00:01:34.979 --> 00:01:37.979
take the top edge fold down to the
bottom edge and run my fingernail

00:01:37.979 --> 00:01:41.189
against that crease really hard so I
could tear it up and down just like that

00:01:41.189 --> 00:01:44.970
then do the same thing fold the top edge
down to the bottom and then I could tear

00:01:44.970 --> 00:01:48.930
it again you can also use scissors if
you want once I have the two quarters of

00:01:48.930 --> 00:01:51.689
the paper I'm gonna make sure that
they're horizontal then I'm going to

00:01:51.689 --> 00:01:55.020
take the top edge and fold it down to
the bottom edge on both of the sheets

00:01:55.020 --> 00:01:59.610
once the edges are lined up then you can
make a crease along the top of the paper

00:01:59.610 --> 00:02:03.540
like that and if you want you could run
your fingernail against the top of the

00:02:03.540 --> 00:02:07.200
edge to make sure that it's nice and sharp
and do the same with the other paper

00:02:07.200 --> 00:02:10.899
fold it down line up the edges and then
make

00:02:10.899 --> 00:02:14.560
once I've done that for both of the
sheets I'm going to take the left side

00:02:14.560 --> 00:02:19.569
of the paper and fold it to the right
edge just like this take it across line

00:02:19.569 --> 00:02:25.989
up the edges here and then I'm going to
make a crease here on the left and if

00:02:25.989 --> 00:02:28.900
you want again run your fingernail
against it to make sure that crease is

00:02:28.900 --> 00:02:32.739
nice and sharp do the same with the
other sheet fold it across line up the

00:02:32.739 --> 00:02:36.730
edges and then make that crease on the
left. Now when you open up the paper

00:02:36.730 --> 00:02:41.530
you'll see that you have a vertical
crease in the paper just like that I'm

00:02:41.530 --> 00:02:45.010
going to make a mark on the vertical
line just so you could see it you don't

00:02:45.010 --> 00:02:49.810
need to make one though. Now I'm going to
take the left side on the bottom and

00:02:49.810 --> 00:02:54.430
it's going to go up and the right side
is going to go down on the vertical

00:02:54.430 --> 00:03:00.030
crease so take the left edge fold it up
onto that crease just like that and

00:03:00.030 --> 00:03:05.260
increase it along this edge here hold
the right side the top edge is going to

00:03:05.260 --> 00:03:09.670
go on to that line just like that and
then again make a crease on the top

00:03:09.670 --> 00:03:15.790
right here do the same with the other
side left goes up right goes down and

00:03:15.790 --> 00:03:19.930
there you go now I'm just going to take
both of the sheets and I'm going to flip

00:03:19.930 --> 00:03:25.389
them over like that now you'll see we
have an edge here in the paper on the

00:03:25.389 --> 00:03:30.459
top and the bottom here I'm going to
take the top of the paper and fold it

00:03:30.459 --> 00:03:35.709
down directly next to that edge once
they're touching like that I'm going to

00:03:35.709 --> 00:03:40.660
make a crease on the top here same with
the bottom bottom goes up next to the

00:03:40.660 --> 00:03:45.160
edge and then make a crease on the
bottom here do the same with the other

00:03:45.160 --> 00:03:51.670
one top goes down and the bottom goes up
so you should have two papers that look

00:03:51.670 --> 00:03:56.349
like this now I'm going to take the
upper right corner and fold it down to

00:03:56.349 --> 00:04:00.819
the lower left corner so just take the
upper right corner and I'm going to fold

00:04:00.819 --> 00:04:05.470
it across the diagonal just like this
you might have to round the paper off a

00:04:05.470 --> 00:04:09.849
little bit so it folds better line it up
with the left side like that and then

00:04:09.849 --> 00:04:15.130
just make a crease now the bottom left
corner is going to go to the upper right

00:04:15.130 --> 00:04:20.959
corner by folding across this diagonal
take it fold it up

00:04:20.959 --> 00:04:27.289
and then you can crease it along the
edge so now your paper should look just

00:04:27.289 --> 00:04:31.550
like this and as you'll see it looks
like a Z if you hold it like that so I

00:04:31.550 --> 00:04:36.080
have a Z here and I'm gonna do the same
with this piece upper right corner down

00:04:36.080 --> 00:04:42.470
to the lower left corner bottom left
corner to the upper right corner so now

00:04:42.470 --> 00:04:47.000
I have another Z so both of the pieces
should look exactly the same now I'm

00:04:47.000 --> 00:04:51.440
going to take the top triangle and fold
it down and I'm going to take the bottom

00:04:51.440 --> 00:04:55.849
triangle and fold it up if they don't
want to fold make sure that these two

00:04:55.849 --> 00:04:59.900
edges are touching like this so if
they're overlapping just pull it like

00:04:59.900 --> 00:05:06.020
that and then crease it okay same here
top triangle goes down and the bottom

00:05:06.020 --> 00:05:10.370
triangle goes up then you can flatten
them out and you're ready to join the

00:05:10.370 --> 00:05:15.860
pieces up so you should have two pieces
of paper that look exactly like this to

00:05:15.860 --> 00:05:19.940
join up the pieces again just open up
these triangles and then we could take

00:05:19.940 --> 00:05:25.070
the one on the right again make sure it
looks like a Z and flip it 90 degrees

00:05:25.070 --> 00:05:29.630
like that then I'm going to put the one
on the right on top of the one on the

00:05:29.630 --> 00:05:35.780
left so that it has an X in the middle
like that they're crossed okay so it

00:05:35.780 --> 00:05:41.780
should look just like this now I'm going
to take the red one which is the bottom

00:05:41.780 --> 00:05:45.500
one and I'm going to take the bottom
triangle and the bottom triangles gonna

00:05:45.500 --> 00:05:50.690
go into the middle first so one and it's
gonna go in a clockwise direction the

00:05:50.690 --> 00:05:56.120
second one is the blue one two three now
it doesn't if it doesn't want to fold

00:05:56.120 --> 00:06:00.289
you just need to move it around a little
bit like that and then again just move

00:06:00.289 --> 00:06:04.340
it back into place so you should have
something that looks like this and the

00:06:04.340 --> 00:06:08.509
last one is going to go over this edge
and it's going to go into that little

00:06:08.509 --> 00:06:12.440
pocket right here so if you want to
stick your fingernail in here and just

00:06:12.440 --> 00:06:16.250
lift up that pocket there like that or
better yet if you want to take a little

00:06:16.250 --> 00:06:22.250
bit of a pen and just open that up like
that now you can take the last one and

00:06:22.250 --> 00:06:27.020
it's gonna go over here and into there
so just round it off a little bit like

00:06:27.020 --> 00:06:29.229
that

00:06:29.520 --> 00:06:35.480
just bend it like this put the tip into
the pocket

00:06:35.480 --> 00:06:39.990
and then just push it in all the way
like that

00:06:39.990 --> 00:06:45.240
once it's in then you could just flatten
it out and you've completed the easiest

00:06:45.240 --> 00:06:50.099
ninja star now let's make it into a
spinner all I do now is basically take

00:06:50.099 --> 00:06:54.990
the end of a paper clip and poke a hole
in the middle of the ninja star by

00:06:54.990 --> 00:06:58.500
putting it right here and just be
careful because it can be sharp put your

00:06:58.500 --> 00:07:03.330
fingers on opposite ends of that little
line and just kind of push it until it

00:07:03.330 --> 00:07:07.620
goes through just like that now you can
just rotate it a little bit and open up

00:07:07.620 --> 00:07:13.590
the hole and as you'll see it will spin
on the paperclip like that but not that

00:07:13.590 --> 00:07:18.389
good so just take it out take the pen
and I'm just gonna put the tip right in

00:07:18.389 --> 00:07:22.199
the middle and just wiggle it until it
goes through a little bit again watch

00:07:22.199 --> 00:07:25.560
your fingers when you're doing that once
it goes through like that so you could

00:07:25.560 --> 00:07:29.190
see the little tip like that then you
could take it out Oh

00:07:29.190 --> 00:07:34.409
as you'll see got a little stuck in
there but the next thing I want to do is

00:07:34.409 --> 00:07:37.979
to pop this out if it doesn't come out
that easy for you by putting your finger

00:07:37.979 --> 00:07:42.960
there what you can do take the scissors
and just kind of get it in that groove

00:07:42.960 --> 00:07:46.710
that's right there between the pen tip
and the rest of the pen there's a little

00:07:46.710 --> 00:07:50.610
groove you'll see here put the scissors
in and you could just squeeze it a

00:07:50.610 --> 00:07:54.900
little bit and that'll pop it out take
it out and you'll see this about an inch

00:07:54.900 --> 00:07:59.280
here but we're just going to use a pinky
width or a bout a centimeter take the

00:07:59.280 --> 00:08:03.479
scissors put it right there at the
centimeter and just aim it down like

00:08:03.479 --> 00:08:08.370
this and squeeze because it's gonna fly
away so now we have that little clear

00:08:08.370 --> 00:08:12.330
plastic tube and I'm just gonna take it
and I'm gonna put the end that we cut

00:08:12.330 --> 00:08:15.780
right through the middle like that and
push it through so that you have about

00:08:15.780 --> 00:08:20.580
the same amount on the back as you do on
the front like that and there you go

00:08:20.580 --> 00:08:25.190
all you need to do put it on the
paperclip

00:08:28.240 --> 00:08:33.610
now if you want to open up the paperclip
a little bit more like this unfold it

00:08:33.610 --> 00:08:44.279
then you can actually move it back and
forth along the paperclip like that

00:08:45.730 --> 00:08:49.910
there you go there's your ninja star
spinner thank you guys so much for

00:08:49.910 --> 00:08:53.510
